  <h2 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Figure 9: Replacing a new ionization chamber and ignition aid</h2>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 40px 0;">
    <!-- Placeholder for the diagram -->
    <div style="position: relative; width: 300px; height: 300px;">
      <img src="placeholder_diagram.png" alt="Diagram" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;">
